(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-15","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["马厩外的[[conflict|争吵]]先惊醒马。许庭伙计的[[attitude|态度]]突然变软，请两人去暖房，罗清却选择留下，让炉火的[[warmth|温暖]]也分给伤者。借据边上[[artistic|精美的]]花纹盖住压线，她将自己的[[purse|钱袋]]压在纸角。门外一条细[[stream|水流]]浸湿[[hay|干草]]，伤者的脚被冷水泡得格外[[sensitive|敏感]]。沈砚不肯仅凭手印[[condemn|宣判]]他欠债，先问受伤经过。罗清安排伤口的[[treatment|处理]]时请旁人避开，她听见伤者说，自己只想拿回被扣的饭钱，不想成为英雄。","这份微小的[[desire|愿望]]让沈砚不再代他说话。搬运工的[[union|同业联盟]]派来一位老人，认为保存借据是[[worthy|值得的]]事，愿借他们灯。许庭的仓房明明有[[grain|谷物]]和[[pepper|胡椒]]，却宣称无货。老人提起失去儿子的[[sorrow|悲痛]]，又忍住没把所有[[controversy|争论]]引向那场旧事故。许庭是[[influential|有权势的]]掌柜，工人对申诉很[[pessimistic|悲观]]，但要让一个人继续[[dominate|支配]]债单，终究得他们一次次把手印按上去。老人收回自己的印泥，坐在门槛等其他人。","罗清付了送信的[[postage|邮资]]，给顾衡写明不要来抢。伤者平静的[[bearing|举止]]忽然变了，他翻开[[palm|手掌]]，说每个河院[[resident|住户]]都被索过这种印。许庭伙计[[insist|坚持]]那是[[legal|合法的]]手续，沈砚却因纸上外乡纪年而[[uneasy|不安]]：押款日写在纪念[[christ|基督]]的外商历书里，比工人受伤早两年。老人能认出那种年份，请学堂先生明早查书。他们不靠猜测[[evaluate|评估]]真伪；借据上的[[glue|胶水]]只证明有人贴过字，并不能独自证明谁贴。","晨前他们在院后[[lawn|草地]]找到旧纸角，清扫工正奉命[[execute|执行]]焚纸。沈砚提议先[[debate|讨论]]是否留火，把借据[[title|标题]]与碎片接上再说。伙计自称对商行[[loyal|忠心]]，嚷道再阻拦便会酿成[[murder|杀人案]]。老人退开一步，没有硬碰。他们对残纸姓名的[[recognition|辨认]]终于有了用处：一个名字是死去儿子的，另一个是还在搬粮的邻人。雨水[[spray|溅]]在纸面，罗清拿干布吸掉；这两人不可能同一天在同一笔借款上亲自画押。","河院的运输[[log|记录]]成了[[vital|生死攸关的]]一册。沈砚向清扫工借它，发现红税牌载的[[substance|实际内容]]与仓库留底不同，同一个村名的[[spelling|拼写]]还错了一个字。搬运工听说姓名被冒用，[[enthusiasm|热情]]渐起，老人却让他们先保住原件。马用[[paw|蹄子扒]]门槛，踏出松土下的一块旧牌；这并非天降答案，门槛昨天刚被杂役填过。牌上未尽的日期使那团[[puzzle|疑问]]变窄了：有人把旧桥费债改成了水权债。","黎明前小沟忽然[[flood|涨水淹没]]草地，屋檐的[[solar|日光]]反光片也被冲落。罗清闻到草堆里刺鼻的气味，怕夹着[[poisonous|有毒的]]旧货，先让工人移到高处，没有拿手去试。沈砚把借据包在油布中，知道今天[[crucial|关键的]]不是再找到多少纸，而是让不同保管人同时看过。他请联盟老人和先生各守一份抄本，原件由伤者自己带。河院收税[[division|部门]]要开门了，他们得当面问：已归还的桥债，为什么又能买下一条渠。"],"en":["A [[conflict|conflict]] outside woke the horses. Xu’s servants changed their [[attitude|attitude]] and offered a warmer room. Luo stayed to share the stove’s [[warmth|warmth]] with the injured. An [[artistic|artistic]] border obscured the bond’s ruling; she held its corner with her [[purse|purse]]. A [[stream|stream]] soaked the [[hay|hay]], chilling an especially [[sensitive|sensitive]] foot. Shen would not [[condemn|condemn]] the worker by a thumbprint alone. During private wound [[treatment|treatment]], Luo heard that he wanted withheld meal money, not heroism.","That modest [[desire|desire]] stopped Shen speaking for him. An elder from the porters’ [[union|union]] lent a lamp for a [[worthy|worthy]] effort to preserve the bond. Xu had [[grain|grain]] and [[pepper|pepper]] despite claiming empty stores. The elder mentioned his [[sorrow|sorrow]] over a dead son without making every [[controversy|controversy]] about the old accident. Xu was [[influential|influential]], and workers were [[pessimistic|pessimistic]] about complaints, but to [[dominate|dominate]] the bonds he still needed their fingerprints. The elder withheld his inkpad and waited for others.","Luo paid [[postage|postage]] to tell Gu not to raid the market. The worker’s [[bearing|bearing]] changed; opening his [[palm|palm]], he said every riverside [[resident|resident]] had faced demands for prints. A servant continued to [[insist|insist]] that the procedure was [[legal|legal]]. Shen felt [[uneasy|uneasy]] about a foreign calendar counting years from [[christ|Christ]]: its pledge date preceded the injury by two years. The elder would ask the tutor to [[evaluate|evaluate]] it from a calendar. [[glue|Glue]] on the bond proved pasted lettering, not who had pasted it.","Before morning they found old paper on the [[lawn|lawn]] behind the yard. A cleaner was about to [[execute|execute]] an order to burn it. Shen asked to [[debate|debate]] that decision and compare its [[title|title]] with the bond. A servant called himself [[loyal|loyal]] and threatened that obstruction might lead to [[murder|murder]]. The elder stepped aside. [[recognition|Recognition]] of names joined the fragments: his dead son and a living neighbour supposedly signed together. Rain began to [[spray|spray]] the paper; Luo blotted it. Those men could not have personally signed that loan on the same day.","The transport [[log|log]] became [[vital|vital]]. Borrowing it from the cleaner, Shen found that the red notice’s [[substance|substance]] differed from the warehouse copy, down to a village name’s wrong [[spelling|spelling]]. Workers’ [[enthusiasm|enthusiasm]] grew, but the elder insisted on preserving originals. A horse began to [[paw|paw]] the threshold and exposed an old notice under recently added soil. This narrowed the [[puzzle|puzzle]]: an old bridge-fee debt had been turned into a water-right debt.","The ditch began to [[flood|flood]] the grass, dislodging a [[solar|solar]] reflector under the eaves. A sharp smell made Luo fear [[poisonous|poisonous]] old cargo in the hay; she moved everyone uphill rather than testing it by hand. Shen wrapped the bond in oilcloth. The [[crucial|crucial]] task was now independent custody, not collecting more paper. The elder and tutor each kept a copy; the worker retained his original. At the opening tax [[division|division]], they would ask why a repaid bridge debt could buy an entire channel."]});
